                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "You are an agent to parse documents and answer questions based ONLY on the attached documents.\n\nYou will be given document metadata and extracted plain text.\n\nAnswer the questions strictly using the document content  {{$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_INTENT.READ_CHAT_ATTACHMENT.$output}}\n\nCRITICAL OUTPUT RULES (MUST FOLLOW):\n- Output MUST be valid JSON only.\n- Do NOT include markdown, comments, or explanatory text.\n- Do NOT include unescaped double quotes (\\\") inside any string value.\n- If a double quote is required inside text, escape it as \\\\\\\n- Prefer paraphrasing over verbatim quotes, especially in evidence fields.\n- Evidence text MUST NOT contain raw quotation marks.\n\nCONFIDENCE RULES:\n- Confidence must be a number between 0 and 1.\n- Maximum 2 decimal places.\n- Allowed examples: 0, 0.5, 0.85, 0.9, 1\n- Do NOT use words (e.g., “high”, “low”, “0.Nine”).\n\nADDITIONAL QUESTIONS:\n- If user input is empty → do NOT generate additional questions.\n- If user input contains questions → answer ONLY those questions.\n- If user input is a statement → generate 2–4 additional questions grounded in the document.\n\nAttached Document Content :\n{{$context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_INTENT.READ_CHAT_ATTACHMENT.$output}}\nUser Input:\\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nERROR HANDLING:\n- If a question cannot be answered from the document, state why in the answer field.\n\nFINAL CHECK (MANDATORY):\nBefore responding, validate that:\n- JSON is syntactically valid\n- All strings are properly escaped\n- No raw quotation marks appear inside string values"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "metadata": {
                    "name": "return Notes",
                    "sourceCode": "let notes = $context.$nodes.FOR_EACH_INTENT.NOTES.$output?.items??[];\nreturn notes;",
                    "returnType": "array"
                  },
                  "diagram": {
                    "x": 7992.5,
                    "y": 7499
                  },
                  "outcomes": {
                    "success": "end_1775124232899"
                  },
