                  "id": "1778143568604",
                  "code": "CONSTRUCT_RAG_QUESTION",
                  "type": "LLM",
                  "inputs": [
                    {
                      "id": "1778143568604_systemPrompt",
                      "name": "systemPrompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": ""
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "1778143568604_prompt",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "The tool has details about product overview, competitive brief, positioning guide, customer success stories, and pricing details.\n\nThe user message {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} contains:\n- userQuery\n- userName\n- recommendation\n- OptySummary\n\nOpportunity Details:\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_OPPORTUNITY_DATA.$output}}\n\nCreate ONE concise RAG question to generate supporting sales content.\n\nRules:\n- Base the question primarily on the recommendation and userQuery.\n- Preserve the specific sales-play action from the recommendation, such as engaging executive sponsors, scheduling executive discovery, understanding strategic priorities, buying criteria, value proposition, objection handling, or talk track.\n- Include the account/customer name and opportunity name when available.\n- Include relevant opportunity-specific details only when they make the sales content more targeted.\n- Do not make the question generic.\n- Do not focus on opportunity summary, stage, probability, or engagement health unless those details are directly relevant to the recommendation.\n- Ask for supporting sales content from product overview, competitive brief, positioning guide, customer success stories, and pricing/pricing details when useful.\n- Return only the final question, with no explanation."
                    }
                  ]
                },
