          "restConfigJson": "{\n    \"insightNumber\": \"\",\n    \"optyDetails\": \"\",\n    \"intentArray\": [\"SALESPLAY\",\"ACCOUNT\"],\n    \"puid\": \"CDRM_155559\",\n    \"_parentWorkflowCode\": \"DEAL_ADVISOR_WORKFLOW\",\n    \"insightId\": \"\",\n    \"id\": \"300100647728031\",\n    \"_parentJobId\": \"85b344cf-6df5-4be1-82cd-24a24f4bad9d\",\n    \"message\": \"{\\\"userQuery\\\":\\\"Identify and Engage Executive Sponsors\\\",\\\"userName\\\":\\\"MHoope\\\",\\\"recommendation\\\":\\\"Map and connect with key executives who influence or approve the purchase decision to gain executive sponsorship and support for the deal.\\\",\\\"OptySummary\\\":\\\"<b>Sentiment</b>: Positive\\\\n<div style=\\\\\\\"margin-left: 20px;\\\\\\\">\\\\n  <ul>\\\\n    <li><b>Product Interest</b>: The opportunity includes Secure Workload Mobility Pack and Enterprise Cloud Governance Toolkit, reflecting a broad platform refresh scope.</li>\\\\n    <li><b>Customer Engagement</b>: Marcus Chen is actively engaged, demonstrated by multiple web interactions including email clicks, content downloads, and a workshop request submission.</li>\\\\n    <li><b>Stakeholder Coverage</b>: Key contacts Olivia Bennett, Marcus Chen, and Sophia Patel are involved, providing solid customer-side engagement.</li>\\\\n    <li><b>Upcoming Activity</b>: A scheduled appointment for opportunity follow-up is set for 2026-05-15, indicating ongoing momentum.</li>\\\\n    <li><b>Commercial Context</b>: The total opportunity value is $195,000 USD, with a standard sales process underway and the deal currently open.</li>\\\\n  </ul>\\\\n</div>\\\"}\",\n    \"_parentAgentTeamNodeCode\": \"GET_INTENT_CONTEXT\"\n  }",
          "inputMessage": "{\\\"userQuery\\\":\\\"Identify and Engage Executive Sponsors\\\",\\\"userName\\\":\\\"MHoope\\\",\\\"recommendation\\\":\\\"Map and connect with key executives who influence or approve the purchase decision to gain executive sponsorship and support for the deal.\\\",\\\"OptySummary\\\":\\\"<b>Sentiment</b>: Positive\\\\n<div style=\\\\\\\"margin-left: 20px;\\\\\\\">\\\\n  <ul>\\\\n    <li><b>Product Interest</b>: The opportunity includes Secure Workload Mobility Pack and Enterprise Cloud Governance Toolkit, reflecting a broad platform refresh scope.</li>\\\\n    <li><b>Customer Engagement</b>: Marcus Chen is actively engaged, demonstrated by multiple web interactions including email clicks, content downloads, and a workshop request submission.</li>\\\\n    <li><b>Stakeholder Coverage</b>: Key contacts Olivia Bennett, Marcus Chen, and Sophia Patel are involved, providing solid customer-side engagement.</li>\\\\n    <li><b>Upcoming Activity</b>: A scheduled appointment for opportunity follow-up is set for 2026-05-15, indicating ongoing momentum.</li>\\\\n    <li><b>Commercial Context</b>: The total opportunity value is $195,000 USD, with a standard sales process underway and the deal currently open.</li>\\\\n  </ul>\\\\n</div>\\\"}"
